{"id":"7d58f8e24dbfba2e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nw-design.md","title":"NW组合设计","display":"df-nw-design — NW组合设计","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-nw-design","aliases":["28-df-nw-design"],"display":"df-nw-design — NW组合设计","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.13","source_printed_pages":"410","source_pdf_pages":"436","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nw-design"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nw-design</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nw-design — NW组合设计"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"410"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"436"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell&gt;n&gt;d\">\\(\\ell&gt;n&gt;d\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\ell]=\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\">\\([\\ell]=\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m\">\\(\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NWDesign}(\\ell,n,d,\\mathcal I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall j\\in[m]\\;|I_j|=n\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall j,k\\in[m]\\;(j\\ne k\\Rightarrow|I_j\\cap I_k|\\le d)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NWDesign}(\\ell,n,d,\\mathcal I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall j\\in[m]\\;|I_j|=n\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall j,k\\in[m]\\;(j\\ne k\\Rightarrow|I_j\\cap I_k|\\le d)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m:\\operatorname{NWDesign}(\\ell,n,d,\\mathcal I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m:\\operatorname{NWDesign}(\\ell,n,d,\\mathcal I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 20.13 的有序族版本。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;d\">\\(n&gt;d\\)</span> 保证不同位置不可能装同一个集合，因此有序族与书中含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个集合的设计对应。排序只确定生成器的输出坐标，不改变交集性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell>n>d","display":false},{"tex":"[\\ell]=\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NWDesign}(\\ell,n,d,\\mathcal I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall j\\in[m]\\;|I_j|=n\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall j,k\\in[m]\\;(j\\ne k\\Rightarrow|I_j\\cap I_k|\\le d)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m:\\operatorname{NWDesign}(\\ell,n,d,\\mathcal I)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"n>d","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":1319,"backlinks":[{"id":"36007dd923c0c8f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ell,n,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$n>d$，$\\ell>10n^2/d$；$m=\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor$。$\\operatorname{NWDesigns}$ 见 [[28-df-nw-design]]。"},{"id":"0079cad93c58c949","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$d,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\ell>n>d$，$0<\\epsilon\\le1/2$。\n$\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}$，$f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma$。设计和生成器见 [[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]；测试类和欺骗谓词见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}